atus of an application using their Student ID and password. If Admin/Teacher requests correction, they can update their details and replace either photo, then resubmit for review. For privacy questions or data access/deletion requests, contact [Name / Office / Contact details to be supplied by the school].</p></div><div class="notice notice-blue"><span class="notice-icon">i</span><p><strong>Important:</strong> This is a draft for an academic prototype, not legal advice and not an approved school privacy policy. The school administration or Data Protection Officer must review it before the system is used with real student data.</p></div></div></section>
